<title>SWITZERLAND: Atel wants to match 1996 results.</title>
<headline>Atel wants to match 1996 results.</headline>
<dateline>OLTEN, Switzerland 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss energy group Aare-Tessin AG (Atel) said it wanted to match the good results achieved during 1996.</p>
<p>&quot;Although the energy business developments were below expectations in February and March due to to mild weather, Atel is making every effort to match the goods results (of 1996),&quot; the company said in a statement</p>
<p>Atel had a 1996 net profit of 167 million Swiss francs on turnover of 1.61 billion.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
